				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "&bLoading \\& Limits"
			x: 2.0d
			y: 1.5d
		}
		{
			description: [
				"&f&lYour factory is one block.&r"
				""
				"&7Compact Machines does not add power, ore or automation. It adds &lspace&r - which on a floating island in the void is the one resource you genuinely cannot make more of.&r"
			]
